      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我会告诉对方“我无法回应这份心意”……\n但还是每年都这样。",
      "source_fingerprint": "341535246137da9bf5421a0836433b3142fbc514a13c5dfd14910680243a29f5",
