    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3ce678cbb800a33820e6947d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我当时的个性比现在还要强硬……\n应该说完全不会想要隐藏这点。\n所以当然也难以融入班级……",
      "source_fingerprint": "0b64442c0c6d88e406d07bbba572c180f932ddd98c152b45886fb322b62eca8d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1057/storytimeline_501057107.json",
      "json_path": [
