    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a3731a883dd2347510770161",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "当时也曾有女孩子鼓起勇气送我巧克力，\n而我只把那个当成是在分享点心，\n就随意地收下了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "48c75060c86849180feebd514173664124d39d37a07ded3821bdab12c577936d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1057/storytimeline_501057107.json",
      "json_path": [
