    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4cd6ccd3e3318d3d94576801",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我吃完以后完全忘了这件事，也没有回礼。\n之后的某一天，在我和朋友一起玩的时候，\n那个女孩子突然跑了过来。",
      "source_fingerprint": "66501c73e458ab29bc458275a046d62e951b8e3a5f3c1326cebd365752d09cb3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1057/storytimeline_501057107.json",
      "json_path": [
